#: ../../05_node-guide/02_node-extensions.md:25
msgid "The `grpc-server` module is not a separate process: it is an in-process node extension. The official Docker image already contains it; for other installs, put its JARs on the node's classpath (the Docker image also loads extra JARs from `lib/plugins/`). The module holds two extensions, each enabled by adding its class to `dcc.extensions`: `com.decentralchain.api.grpc.GRPCServerExtension` for the APIs on port 6870 (commented out in the node's default `application.conf`), and `com.decentralchain.events.BlockchainUpdates` for port 6881 (see [Blockchain Updates](../04_building-apps/11_blockchain-updates)). Enabling them is a deployment decision for the node operator, not a REST API toggle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../05_node-guide/03_custom-blockchain.md:1
